      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-12-13T20:51:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If `panic` is acceptable over `os.Exit`, I can just use it. It won\u0027t give me the $PWD, but that\u0027s just a nicety. I don\u0027t have access to a `ctx`, otherwise yes I\u0027d have done e.g. `ModuleError` as elsewhere.\n\nBut what I\u0027m hearing it \"change this later if at all; keep this in mind\". So don\u0027t reup.",
      "parentUuid": "7fc0a569_e66fa269",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 69,
